# Agent scratch. Several mailbox briefs direct a worker to write a throwaway demo to
# .openclaw/tmp/<name>.ts *inside the repo*, so this path is expected to appear — it must never be
# committed. Real temp files belong at the workspace root (.openclaw/tmp), not here.
.openclaw/
